libjpeg-turbo / Independent JPEG Group
--------------------------------------
Ported: jidctint.c (jpeg_idct_islow), jdsample.c (fancy upsampling),
jdcolor.c (ycc_rgb_convert), jdmaster.c (range-limit table), jdmainct.c
(context-row edge handling), jdapimin.c (colour space defaults), and the
Huffman decoding rules of jdhuff.c/jdphuff.c, translated from C to Rust.
This is libjpeg-turbo's core libjpeg API library (decode path and
inherited/modified libjpeg code), covered solely by the IJG License; the
separate Modified (3-clause) BSD License covers the TurboJPEG API library,
cjpeg/djpeg, libspng and the build/test system, none of which is used here.

